cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "Khmer Official Terminology (khmer-lexicon)"
abstract: >-
  A compiled, provenance-annotated lexicon of official Cambodian government
  terminology (Khmer / English / French), extracted by OCR from published
  ministry and Royal Academy documents and normalised into a single structured
  dataset. Includes the extraction pipeline, normalisation rules, and a Khmer
  orthography checker.
type: dataset
